				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<ul><li>Prizes <b>bigger than €449 are subject to the automatic withholding</b> of the applicable gambling tax of 34.20%.</li><li>Lotto X is a <a href="https://lotterytexts.com/blog/how-second-chance-lottery-works/">second-chance lottery drawing</a> and can only be played if you are already purchasing a regular Netherlands Lotto ticket.</li><li>According to the rules, drawings may occur between 06:05 p.m. and 7:30 p.m. Also, expect the Netherlands Lotto XL results to be published by 09:00 p.m. </li><li>The Special Saturday drawing occurs on the last Saturday of the month and gets players not one but two drawings instead, at 6 p.m.</li><li>After the drawing, winners have up to 365 days to redeem their prize. That is more than enough to check the Lotto XL winning numbers, plan your next moves, and make the claim!</li><li>You can only play this game in <a href="https://lotterytexts.com/netherlands/">the Netherlands</a>. It is also exclusive to people <b>who are at least 18 years old</b>, as in most countries.</li><li>The additional number is not chosen but rather randomly drawn to pay specific prize tiers.</li></ul><h3>How to Play Lotto XL (Netherlands)?</h3><p>You may play Lotto XL in the Netherlands<b> if you are purchasing a regular Lotto ticket </b>and are currently in the country. There are many similar lotteries to play on a <a href="https://lotterytexts.com/best-lottery-sites/">lottery website</a> if you are somewhere else, but locals and visitors may enjoy the XL second-chance lottery this way:</p><ol><li>Get yourself a digital Lotto play slip on the official Netherlands Lottery website or ask for one at any authorized retailer.</li><li>Start by <b>choosing six numbers from 1 to 45 in each Lotto panel</b> that you wish to convert into a ticket. Remember that those same numbers will be valid for Lotto XL.</li><li>Mark the Lotto XL option, knowing that there is an extra cost for each Lotto panel that also comes with the XL second draw.</li><li>If you are really willing to guarantee your participation in future drawings, select the corresponding multi-draw option.</li><li><b>Revise your numbers, and if everything seems correct, pay</b> for the panels to receive your tickets. They can be checked on the app, so keep paper tickets safe until the possible prize claim.</li><li>Check out the Lotto XL winning numbers in our results here every Saturday after 9 p.m. local time.</li></ol><h3>Lotto XL (Netherlands) Lottery Ticket Cost</h3><ul><li>€1 to add it to a Lotto ticket.</li><li>€3 total per entry.</li></ul><h3>Advance Drawings in the Lotto XL (Netherlands)</h3><p>You may make your ticket with Lotto and Lotto XL be valid for many other drawings and save time by not having to go to the retailer again. That option, which is also available online, allows <b>up to 12 consecutive drawings </b>to be added to your ticket with the multi-draw choice. If you do it, do not forget to come back and check the Lotto XL lottery results.</p>								</div>
